    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "\n## 🌍 Planet Pulse\n**Observability for planet Earth - and for the public APIs that watch it.**\nEarthquakes (USGS), space weather (NOAA SWPC), weather & air quality (Open-Meteo) collected by **Grafana Alloy** through\n**json-exporter** (no custom code), stored in **Prometheus**, with **SLOs** on the data providers themselves\n(multi-window multi-burn-rate alerts from the Google SRE Workbook), logs in **Loki** and notifications in **ntfy**.\n\n[🌋 Earthquakes](/d/pp-earthquakes) · [☀️ Space weather](/d/pp-space) · [🌦️ Weather & air](/d/pp-weather) ·\n[🎯 SLOs](/d/pp-slo) · [🛠️ Platform](/d/pp-platform) · [📊 API usage](/d/pp-api-usage) · [🔔 Alerting](/alerting/list) · [📨 ntfy](http://localhost:8080/planet-pulse-planet)\n"
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
